-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"א/6, 14 February 2021: פרישה מוקדמת מעבודת ההוראה
-- בתום שנה"ל תשפ"א
-- Early retirement at the end of school year תשפ"א (31.8.2021) for teaching
-- employees of the owners of post-primary institutions: the two tracks and
-- their ages, veteran and new pension funds, the request and its deadline,
-- the limit on work after retirement, and the documents to attach.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in DAYS from the circular's
-- date, 14 February 2021 (day 0), except where a rule says otherwise.
`31 May 2021`      MEANS 106
`31 August 2021`   MEANS 198
`30 November 2021` MEANS 289

§ `חוזר תשפ"א/6 פרישה מוקדמת בתום שנה"ל תשפ"א`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 Letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p2 Letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p3 Letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p4 Letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p5 Letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p6 The Hebrew date; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p7 The Gregorian date, 14.2.2021; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p8 The reference number; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p9 The circular's number; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p10 Addressee; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p11 Addressee: the teaching employees and the owners of post-primary institutions; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p12 Greeting; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p13 Subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `sex` IS ONE OF `woman`, `man`

DECLARE `pension fund kind` IS ONE OF
    `a veteran fund (מבטחים, ק.ג.מ, גלעד, מקפת)`
    `a new pension fund`

@desc A teaching employee asking to retire early at the end of תשפ"א, as far as the circular asks about it.
DECLARE `early-retirement candidate` HAS
    `employee sex`                              IS A `sex`
    `age at retirement`                         IS A NUMBER  @desc age in whole years on 31.8.2021
    `employed by an owner of a post-primary institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in official education`                     IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed in the official (רשמי) education system, for which the tracks are not meant
    `insured in a funded pension fund`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `fund`                                      IS A `pension fund kind`
    `receives an early pension from any source` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `המסלולים`

-- ¶14: under the agreements of 11.5.93, 19.9.94 and 12.9.95, two tracks
-- for employees of the owners of post-primary institutions insured in
-- funded pension funds; not for employees in official education.
@ref akn:hc_1/p14
GIVEN c IS AN `early-retirement candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the arrangement` c IF
        c's `employed by an owner of a post-primary institution`
    AND c's `insured in a funded pension fund`
    AND NOT c's `in official education`

DECLARE `track` IS ONE OF
    `track A, the additional track`
    `track B, קפ"מ the early pension fund`

-- ¶15-¶20: the ages of each track, one row per printed line, as printed.
@ref akn:hc_1/p15 akn:hc_1/p16 akn:hc_1/p17 akn:hc_1/p18 akn:hc_1/p19 akn:hc_1/p20
DECLARE `track ages` HAS
    `track of the row` IS A `track`
    `sex of the row`   IS A `sex`
    `from age`         IS A NUMBER
    `to age`           IS A NUMBER

`the tracks' ages` MEANS
    LIST `track ages` `track A, the additional track`        `woman` 50 55,
         `track ages` `track A, the additional track`        `man`   50 58,
         `track ages` `track B, קפ"מ the early pension fund` `woman` 55 62,
         `track ages` `track B, קפ"מ the early pension fund` `man`   58 67

GIVEN s IS A `sex`, a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `track`
DECIDE `the tracks printed for` s `at age` a IS
    map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `track of the row`)
        (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `sex of the row` EQUALS s AND a AT LEAST r's `from age` AND a AT MOST r's `to age`)
                `the tracks' ages`)

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_06-a: track A runs "to 55" (women) and "to 58" (men);
-- track B runs "from 55" and "from 58". Read with "עד" inclusive, the age
-- that ends one track opens the other:
`the boundary ages are in both tracks` MEANS
        `the tracks printed for` `woman` `at age` 55 EQUALS LIST `track A, the additional track`, `track B, קפ"מ the early pension fund`
    AND `the tracks printed for` `man` `at age` 58 EQUALS LIST `track A, the additional track`, `track B, קפ"מ the early pension fund`
#ASSERT `the boundary ages are in both tracks`

-- Every other age from 50 to the track's end has one track.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD count (`the tracks printed for` `woman` `at age` a) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 50, 51, 52, 53, 54, 56, 57, 58, 59, 60, 61, 62)
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD count (`the tracks printed for` `man` `at age` a) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 50, 51, 52, 53, 54, 55, 56, 57, 59, 60, 65, 66, 67)

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_06-a): the boundary age belongs to
-- the track that opens at it, track A's "עד" read as excluding it.
GIVEN c IS AN `early-retirement candidate`
GIVETH A LIST OF `track`
DECIDE `the track for` c IS
    filter (GIVEN t YIELD NOT (t EQUALS `track A, the additional track`
                               AND elem `track B, קפ"מ the early pension fund` (`the tracks printed for` (c's `employee sex`) `at age` (c's `age at retirement`))))
           (`the tracks printed for` (c's `employee sex`) `at age` (c's `age at retirement`))

@export default Whether a teaching employee of a post-primary owner may retire early at the end of 2020-21 under circular תשפ"א/6, and on which track
GIVEN c IS AN `early-retirement candidate` @desc the candidate
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may retire early` c IF
        `within the arrangement` c
    AND NOT null (`the track for` c)
    AND NOT c's `receives an early pension from any source`

§§ `קרנות ותיקות וחדשות`

DECLARE `who pays the pension` IS ONE OF
    `the veteran fund itself`
    `the last employer, from the Treasury's pensions administration`

-- ¶21: veteran funds — by the tracks and the funds' bylaws; the funds pay.
-- ¶23-¶24: new funds — the salary commissioner's arrangement of 4.11.08,
-- on the same terms as tracks A and B; the pensions administration at the
-- Accountant General computes the pension from the accumulated balance by
-- an agreed formula (an input), and periods in veteran funds or budgetary
-- pension count too. ¶26: the administration transfers it to the last
-- employer, who passes it to the employee.
@ref akn:hc_1/p21 akn:hc_1/p23 akn:hc_1/p24 akn:hc_1/p26
GIVEN c IS AN `early-retirement candidate`
GIVETH A `who pays the pension`
DECIDE `the pension is paid by` c IS
    CONSIDER c's `fund`
    WHEN `a veteran fund (מבטחים, ק.ג.מ, גלעד, מקפת)` THEN `the veteran fund itself`
    WHEN `a new pension fund` THEN `the last employer, from the Treasury's pensions administration`

DECLARE `retirement action` IS ONE OF
    `return the forms and deal with the fund`
    `arrange the budgetary-pension rights with the district`
    `pass the pension on to the employee`
    `submit the request on the teachers' portal` HAS `with complete data and documents` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employ the retiree` HAS `position fraction employed` IS A NUMBER
                             `at the Ministry of Education` IS A BOOLEAN
    `sign a declaration of no other early pension`
    `place another teacher in the post`
    `stop the state-funded pension`

-- ¶22: for veteran funds, returning the forms and dealing with the fund
-- until 30.11.21 only.
@ref akn:hc_1/p22
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `retirement action`
DECIDE `returning the veteran-fund forms` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `return the forms and deal with the fund`
    WITHIN `30 November 2021`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/6: the forms are returned and the fund dealt with by 30.11.21 only"

-- ¶25: the employee arranges the budgetary-pension rights with the
-- district before the retirement date.
@ref akn:hc_1/p25
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `retirement action`
DECIDE `arranging the budgetary-pension rights` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `arrange the budgetary-pension rights with the district`
    WITHIN `31 August 2021`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/6: the employee arranges the budgetary-pension rights before the retirement date"

-- ¶26: the last employer passes the pension on. The text sets no time:
-- each month's pension is passed on within that month (time in months).
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `retirement action`
DECIDE `passing the pension on` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pass the pension on to the employee`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/6: the last employer is responsible for passing the new-fund pension on to the employee"

§§ `הגשת הבקשות`

-- ¶27-¶30: the request is filed on the teachers' portal ("retirement
-- from a post-primary owner") until 31.05.2021, when the system closes;
-- the requests go to the early-retirement committee through the union.
-- The appendix: data or documents incomplete, the request is returned.
@ref akn:hc_1/p27 akn:hc_1/p28 akn:hc_1/p29 akn:hc_1/p30 akn:att_1__hc_1/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `retirement action`
DECIDE `submitting the request` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `submit the request on the teachers' portal` `complete`
          PROVIDED `complete`
    WITHIN `31 May 2021`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/6: a complete request is filed on the portal by 31.05.2021, when the system closes"

DECLARE `request route` IS ONE OF
    `to the early-retirement committee through the representing union`

@ref akn:hc_1/p29
`where the requests go` MEANS
    `to the early-retirement committee through the representing union`

-- ¶31: in the first two years after retirement, no employment in official
-- or recognised unofficial institutions above a third of a position; work
-- at the Ministry of Education alongside the owner may go on. Time here in
-- months from the retirement.
@ref akn:hc_1/p31
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `retirement action`
DECIDE `no more than a third of a position for two years` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `employ the retiree` `fraction` `at the Ministry`
          PROVIDED `fraction` GREATER THAN 1 DIVIDED BY 3 AND NOT `at the Ministry`
    WITHIN 24
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/6: a retiree is not employed above a third of a position in the first two years"

-- ¶32: the applicant signs a declaration that he receives no early pension
-- from any source; if he does, the state-funded pension stops at once.
@ref akn:hc_1/p32
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `retirement action`
DECIDE `declaring no other early pension` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `sign a declaration of no other early pension`
    WITHIN `31 May 2021`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/6: the applicant declares he receives no early pension from any source"

GIVEN c IS AN `early-retirement candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the state-funded pension stops at once` c IF
    c's `receives an early pension from any source`

-- akn:hc_1/p33 The committee's coordinators for questions; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p34 A coordinator's phone and e-mail; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p35 A coordinator's phone and e-mail; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p36 The telephone hours; no rule.

-- ¶37: until the employee has the Ministry's official letter approving the
-- retirement, no other teacher is placed in his post.
@ref akn:hc_1/p37
GIVEN `the approval letter has been received` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `retirement action`
DECIDE `no replacement before the approval letter` `the approval letter has been received` IS
    IF `the approval letter has been received`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         SHANT `place another teacher in the post`
         WITHIN `31 August 2021`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/6: no teacher is placed in the post before the approval letter"

-- akn:conclusions The signature and copies list; no rule.

§§ `נספח — המסמכים לצירוף`

DECLARE `document to attach` IS ONE OF
    `personal data and the last payslip`
    `each pension fund's latest report for תשפ"א`
    `budgetary-pension periods, freezing letter or continuity agreement and service record`
    `a signed power of attorney for each new fund`
    `the last employing owner's details`
    `a full declaration of any other early pension, with its payslip`

-- א: personal data, the last payslip, every pension fund with its latest
-- report (pension funds only, not provident or study funds). ב: periods in
-- the civil service under budgetary pension, and the freezing letter or
-- continuity agreement and service record. ג: a power of attorney for the
-- pensions administration for each new fund. ד: the last employing owner's
-- details in it. ה: any other early pension, declared in full, with a slip.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_a akn:att_1__hc_1__para_b akn:att_1__hc_1__para_c/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_c/p8 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_d akn:att_1__hc_1__para_e/p1
GIVEN `in the civil service under budgetary pension` IS A BOOLEAN
      `insured in a new fund` IS A BOOLEAN
      `receives another early pension` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `document to attach`
DECIDE `the documents to attach` `in the civil service under budgetary pension` `insured in a new fund` `receives another early pension` IS
    concat (LIST (LIST `personal data and the last payslip`, `each pension fund's latest report for תשפ"א`),
                 (IF `in the civil service under budgetary pension` THEN LIST `budgetary-pension periods, freezing letter or continuity agreement and service record` ELSE EMPTY),
                 (IF `insured in a new fund` THEN LIST `a signed power of attorney for each new fund`, `the last employing owner's details` ELSE EMPTY),
                 (IF `receives another early pension` THEN LIST `a full declaration of any other early pension, with its payslip` ELSE EMPTY))

-- Corpus defect (reported, not a finding): the corpus keeps the page
-- footer and letterhead inside the appendix's paragraphs ג and ה.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_c/p2 A page footer (address and telephone) the corpus keeps inside the paragraph; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_c/p3 The page footer in Arabic; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_c/p4 The page footer's privacy notice; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_c/p5 The next page's letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_c/p6 The next page's letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_c/p7 The next page's letterhead; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_e/p2 A page footer the corpus keeps inside the paragraph; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_e/p3 The page footer in Arabic; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1__para_e/p4 The page footer's privacy notice; no rule.

-- Worked examples.
`a woman of 55 in a new fund` MEANS
    `early-retirement candidate` WITH
        `employee sex`                              IS `woman`
        `age at retirement`                         IS 55
        `employed by an owner of a post-primary institution` IS TRUE
        `in official education`                     IS FALSE
        `insured in a funded pension fund`          IS TRUE
        `fund`                                      IS `a new pension fund`
        `receives an early pension from any source` IS FALSE

`a man of 60 in official education` MEANS
    `early-retirement candidate` WITH
        `employee sex`                              IS `man`
        `age at retirement`                         IS 60
        `employed by an owner of a post-primary institution` IS TRUE
        `in official education`                     IS TRUE
        `insured in a funded pension fund`          IS TRUE
        `fund`                                      IS `a veteran fund (מבטחים, ק.ג.מ, גלעד, מקפת)`
        `receives an early pension from any source` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the track for` `a woman of 55 in a new fund` EQUALS LIST `track B, קפ"מ the early pension fund`
#ASSERT `may retire early` `a woman of 55 in a new fund`
#ASSERT NOT `may retire early` `a man of 60 in official education`
#ASSERT `the pension is paid by` `a woman of 55 in a new fund` EQUALS `the last employer, from the Treasury's pensions administration`
#ASSERT count (`the documents to attach` FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS 4

#TRACE `submitting the request` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee` DOES `submit the request on the teachers' portal` TRUE AT 90
#TRACE `submitting the request` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee` DOES `submit the request on the teachers' portal` TRUE AT 120
#TRACE `no more than a third of a position for two years` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `employ the retiree` 0.5 FALSE AT 6
#TRACE `no more than a third of a position for two years` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `employ the retiree` 0.5 TRUE AT 6
#TRACE `no replacement before the approval letter` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `place another teacher in the post` AT 150
